:0.0,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":5,"id":"S06","text":"静かな夜に一人でお茶を飲むのが、私の楽しみなの。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.5283098220825195,"cer":0.041666666666666664},"grpo":{"score":4.500162124633789,"cer":0.041666666666666664},"best_of_8":{"score":4.562928676605225,"cer":0.041666666666666664,"seed":106,"k":7}}},{"idx":6,"id":"S07","text":"その花はね、春になるとゆっくり咲き始めるんだよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.221758842468262,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.3793511390686035,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.572140693664551,"cer":0.08333333333333333,"seed":103,"k":4}}},{"idx":7,"id":"S08","text":"ちょっと疲れちゃったから、今日は早めに休もうかな。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.512690544128418,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.589207172393799,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.544514179229736,"cer":0.0,"seed":104,"k":5}}},{"idx":8,"id":"S09","text":"昔ここで友達とよく遊んだことを、ふと思い出したよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.411601543426514,"cer":0.04},"grpo":{"score":4.493536949157715,"cer":0.04},"best_of_8":{"score":4.579782485961914,"cer":0.04,"seed":104,"k":5}}},{"idx":9,"id":"S10","text":"あれ、この道って前に通ったことがあったかなあ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.521886348724365,"cer":0.13043478260869565},"grpo":{"score":4.512993335723877,"cer":0.17391304347826086},"best_of_8":{"score":4.559215545654297,"cer":0.043478260869565216,"seed":106,"k":7}}},{"idx":10,"id":"S11","text":"今日はちゃんと早起きできて、なんだか気分がいいな。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.359374523162842,"cer":0.08},"grpo":{"score":4.434667587280273,"cer":0.08},"best_of_8":{"score":4.509259223937988,"cer":0.04,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":11,"id":"S12","text":"明日の天気、もしかしたら雨になるかもしれないって。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.405681610107422,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.405831336975098,"cer":0.12},"best_of_8":{"score":4.492156982421875,"cer":0.0,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":12,"id":"S13","text":"わあ、このお菓子めっちゃかわいい〜！食べるのもったいないよ〜！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.468151807785034,"cer":0.3870967741935484},"grpo":{"score":4.045528411865234,"cer":0.22580645161290322},"best_of_8":{"score":3.810044765472412,"cer":0.5483870967741935,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":13,"id":"S14","text":"もう〜、またいじわるするんだから〜！知らないもん！","sides":{"base":{"score":4.084949493408203,"cer":0.28},"grpo":{"score":4.335244178771973,"cer":0.44},"best_of_8":{"score":3.907337188720703,"cer":0.52,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":14,"id":"S15","text":"そうなのそうなの！私もずっとそう思ってたんだよ〜！","sides":{"base":{"score":4.486875057220459,"cer":0.24},"grpo":{"score":4.353761672973633,"cer":0.12},"best_of_8":{"score":4.389346122741699,"cer":0.28,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":15,"id":"S16","text":"おはよう〜！今日も一緒に遊ぼうね、約束だよ！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.6018388271331787,"cer":0.22727272727272727},"grpo":{"score":4.242770195007324,"cer":0.2727272727272727},"best_of_8":{"score":4.152432918548584,"cer":0.2727272727272727,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":16,"id":"S17","text":"えへへ、内緒だよ〜。誰にも言っちゃだめだからね？","sides":{"base":{"score":3.6352968215942383,"cer":1.4583333333333333},"grpo":{"score":4.436517715454102,"cer":0.2916666666666667},"best_of_8":{"score":4.387386798858643,"cer":0.25,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":17,"id":"S18","text":"絶対に諦めないから！私の力を見せてあげる！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.3278489112854004,"cer":0.2857142857142857},"grpo":{"score":4.1587042808532715,"cer":0.09523809523809523},"best_of_8":{"score":3.9283902645111084,"cer":0.09523809523809523,"seed":104,"k":5}}},{"idx":18,"id":"S19","text":"べ、別にあなたのためじゃないんだからね！勘違いしないでよ！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.886188268661499,"cer":0.13793103448275862},"grpo":{"score":4.115650177001953,"cer":0.13793103448275862},"best_of_8":{"score":4.459217071533203,"cer":0.06896551724137931,"seed":103,"k":4}}},{"idx":19,"id":"S20","text":"この世界の真実を、君はまだ何も知らないんだよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.518795013427734,"cer":0.043478260869565216},"grpo":{"score":4.442885398864746,"cer":0.043478260869565216},"best_of_8":{"score":4.565781116485596,"cer":0.043478260869565216,"seed":105,"k":6}}},{"idx":20,"id":"S21","text":"よーし、みんな準備はいい？全力で行くよー！","sides":{"base":{"score":4.194451332092285,"cer":0.19047619047619047},"grpo":{"score":4.292412757873535,"cer":0.23809523809523808},"best_of_8":{"score":4.494306564331055,"cer":0.09523809523809523,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":21,"id":"S22","text":"大丈夫だよ、私がそばにいるから。安心して。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.548891067504883,"cer":0.047619047619047616},"grpo":{"score":4.494302749633789,"cer":0.2857142857142857},"best_of_8":{"score":4.576282501220703,"cer":0.047619047619047616,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":22,"id":"S23","text":"昨日は友達と新しいカフェでお昼ご飯を食べました。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.519317626953125,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.519863128662109,"cer":0.041666666666666664},"best_of_8":{"score":4.530662536621094,"cer":0.0,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":23,"id":"S24","text":"今週末は家族みんなで近くの公園に行く予定です。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.477062702178955,"cer":0.043478260869565216},"grpo":{"score":4.378500461578369,"cer":0.043478260869565216},"best_of_8":{"score":4.483819961547852,"cer":0.043478260869565216,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":24,"id":"S25","text":"この料理の作り方は、インターネットで簡単に調べられます。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.5283613204956055,"cer":0.03571428571428571},"grpo":{"score":4.461544036865234,"cer":0.03571428571428571},"best_of_8":{"score":4.517788410186768,"cer":0.03571428571428571,"seed":103,"k":4}}},{"idx":25,"id":"S26","text":"駅前の新しいビルは、来月から営業を始めるそうです。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.236549377441406,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.30643892288208,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.518291473388672,"cer":0.0,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":26,"id":"S27","text":"毎朝コーヒーを飲みながらニュースをチェックしています。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.566486835479736,"cer":0.037037037037037035},"grpo":{"score":4.505844593048096,"cer":0.037037037037037035},"best_of_8":{"score":4.60414981842041,"cer":0.037037037037037035,"seed":100,"k":1}}},{"idx":27,"id":"S28","text":"この電車は次の駅で乗り換えると、もっと早く着きますよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.4703569412231445,"cer":0.037037037037037035},"grpo":{"score":4.431109428405762,"cer":0.1111111111111111},"best_of_8":{"score":4.544337272644043,"cer":0.0,"seed":103,"k":4}}},{"idx":28,"id":"S29","text":"夏よりも秋の方が過ごしやすくて好きなんです。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.538246154785156,"cer":0.09090909090909091},"grpo":{"score":4.525608062744141,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.579270362854004,"cer":0.09090909090909091,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":29,"id":"S30","text":"最近は本を読む時間がなかなか取れなくて困っています。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.461923599243164,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.529820919036865,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.571478843688965,"cer":0.038461538461538464,"seed":104,"k":5}}},{"idx":30,"id":"S31","text":"やった！今度のお祭り、絶対みんなで行こうよ！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.7277045249938965,"cer":0.18181818181818182},"grpo":{"score":3.990704298019409,"cer":0.22727272727272727},"best_of_8":{"score":4.004743576049805,"cer":0.09090909090909091,"seed":105,"k":6}}},{"idx":31,"id":"S32","text":"うそでしょ？こんなことが本当に起きるなんて、ありえない！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.7477521896362305,"cer":0.10714285714285714},"grpo":{"score":4.432010173797607,"cer":0.14285714285714285},"best_of_8":{"score":3.8846096992492676,"cer":0.17857142857142858,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":32,"id":"S33","text":"大丈夫、ゆっくりでいいから、自分のペースで進んでいこう。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.388066291809082,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.511594772338867,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.539123058319092,"cer":0.0,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":33,"id":"S34","text":"窓の外の景色をぼんやり眺めていると、心が落ち着いてくるんだ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.527573108673096,"cer":0.13333333333333333},"grpo":{"score":4.549740314483643,"cer":0.13333333333333333},"best_of_8":{"score":4.5697174072265625,"cer":0.1,"seed":106,"k":7}}},{"idx":34,"id":"S35","text":"明日の発表、ちゃんと準備できたかな、ちょっとドキドキするな。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.443338394165039,"cer":0.03333333333333333},"grpo":{"score":4.505875587463379,"cer":0.1},"best_of_8":{"score":4.477008819580078,"cer":0.03333333333333333,"seed":104,"k":5}}},{"idx":35,"id":"S36","text":"いつも気にかけてくれて、本当にありがとう。心強いよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.100520610809326,"cer":0.15384615384615385},"grpo":{"score":4.492210865020752,"cer":0.23076923076923078},"best_of_8":{"score":4.336967468261719,"cer":0.0,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":36,"id":"S37","text":"きゃー！見て見て、このぬいぐるみ超ふわふわ〜！抱きしめたい〜！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.0586960315704346,"cer":0.45161290322580644},"grpo":{"score":4.164089202880859,"cer":0.3870967741935484},"best_of_8":{"score":1.9459151029586792,"cer":1.0,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":37,"id":"S38","text":"ごめんね〜、今ちょっと忙しくて、あとでちゃんと聞くから〜！","sides":{"base":{"score":3.3257927894592285,"cer":0.5172413793103449},"grpo":{"score":4.3164825439453125,"cer":0.27586206896551724},"best_of_8":{"score":4.321298599243164,"cer":0.41379310344827586,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":38,"id":"S39","text":"ふん、別にそんなの欲しくないし。あんたが食べていいよ、ほんとに。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.505842685699463,"cer":0.0625},"grpo":{"score":4.435264587402344,"cer":0.1875},"best_of_8":{"score":4.565176486968994,"cer":0.09375,"seed":100,"k":1}}},{"idx":39,"id":"S40","text":"あなたが頑張っているの、ちゃんと見てるからね。無理しないで。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.4492926597595215,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.539821147918701,"cer":0.1},"best_of_8":{"score":4.56784200668335,"cer":0.03333333333333333,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":40,"id":"S41","text":"今日の会議は予定より少し早く終わったので、助かりました。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.571005821228027,"cer":0.03571428571428571},"grpo":{"score":4.529466152191162,"cer":0.03571428571428571},"best_of_8":{"score":4.590610980987549,"cer":0.03571428571428571,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":41,"id":"S42","text":"最近は朝晩が冷え込むようになって、もう秋ですね。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.234485149383545,"cer":0.20833333333333334},"grpo":{"score":4.359175682067871,"cer":0.125},"best_of_8":{"score":4.386026859283447,"cer":0.08333333333333333,"seed":101,"k":2}}},{"idx":42,"id":"S43","text":"雨が降っているけど、子供が飴を欲しがって泣いているんだ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.416995048522949,"cer":0.10714285714285714},"grpo":{"score":4.37637996673584,"cer":0.07142857142857142},"best_of_8":{"score":4.516921043395996,"cer":0.07142857142857142,"seed":102,"k":3}}},{"idx":43,"id":"S44","text":"このアプリのインターフェース、デザインが本当にスタイリッシュだよね。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.32100248336792,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.515254020690918,"cer":0.029411764705882353},"best_of_8":{"score":4.500772476196289,"cer":0.029411764705882353,"seed":105,"k":6}}},{"idx":44,"id":"S45","text":"オンラインミーティングのスケジュール、リスケジュールしてもらえますか。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.395389556884766,"cer":0.02857142857142857},"grpo":{"score":4.391870498657227,"cer":0.05714285714285714},"best_of_8":{"score":4.49595832824707,"cer":0.02857142857142857,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":45,"id":"S46","text":"来年度の予算配分について、関係部署と慎重に協議する必要があります。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.551673412322998,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.561521530151367,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.539090633392334,"cer":0.0,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":46,"id":"S47","text":"二千二十六年四月十五日午後三時二十五分の待ち合わせです。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.425280570983887,"cer":0.4642857142857143},"grpo":{"score":4.455478668212891,"cer":0.6071428571428571},"best_of_8":{"score":4.259379863739014,"cer":0.6428571428571429,"seed":0,"k":0}}},{"idx":47,"id":"S48","text":"子供の頃に住んでいた町を久しぶりに訪れたら、昔よく遊んだ公園が今も変わらずそこにあって、なんだか胸がいっぱいになったよ。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.577642917633057,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.549307823181152,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.630026340484619,"cer":0.0,"seed":103,"k":4}}},{"idx":48,"id":"S49","text":"桜の花って一年のうち本当にわずかな時期しか咲かないからこそ、その短い時間を大切に楽しもうって気持ちになるんだよね。","sides":{"base":{"score":4.434818267822266,"cer":0.0},"grpo":{"score":4.418445587158203,"cer":0.0},"best_of_8":{"score":4.557981491088867,"cer":0.0,"seed":106,"k":7}}},{"idx":49,"id":"S50","text":"昨日見た映画がね、最初は普通かなと思ってたんだけど、後半になって急に展開が面白くなって、最後は感動しちゃったんだ！","sides":{"base":{"score":4.400478363037109,"cer":0.05263157894736842},"grpo":{"score":4.457305908203125,"cer":0.017543859649122806},"best_of_8":{"score":4.453119277954102,"cer":0.03508771929824561,"seed":103,"k":4}}}]},{"key":"en_animescore","label":"AnimeScore","lang":"EN","metric":"animescore","metric_label":"AnimeScore","step":900,"sides":["base","grpo"],"blurb":"The same AnimeScore + zone-CER recipe transferred to English prompts. Per-item machine scores were not part of the cross-axis release, so only audio is shown.","items":[{"idx":0,"id":"S01","text":"Yes! I finally got my hands on the new game!","sides":{}},{"idx":1,"id":"S02","text":"Wait, seriously? I can't believe it, what a crazy coincidence!","sides":{}},{"idx":2,"id":"S03","text":"I can't take this anymore! Why won't anyone listen to me?!","sides":{}},{"idx":3,"id":"S04","text":"Everyone, come over here! You absolutely cannot miss today's event!","sides":{}},{"idx":4,"id":"S05","text":"Whenever I think back to that day, my heart still aches a little.","sides":{}},{"idx":5,"id":"S06","text":"Drinking tea alone on a quiet night is one of my little joys.","sides":{}},{"idx":6,"id":"S07","text":"You see, that flower slowly starts to bloom when spring arrives.","sides":{}},{"idx":7,"id":"S08","text":"I'm feeling a little tired, so I think I'll turn in early tonight.","sides":{}},{"idx":8,"id":"S09","text":"I just suddenly remembered playing here with my friends a long time ago.","sides":{}},{"idx":9,"id":"S10","text":"Huh, I wonder if I've actually walked down this road before.","sides":{}},{"idx":10,"id":"S11","text":"I actually managed to get up early today, and I feel pretty good somehow.","sides":{}},{"idx":11,"id":"S12","text":"They're saying tomorrow's weather might just turn into rain, you know.","sides":{}},{"idx":12,"id":"S13","text":"Wooow, this candy is sooo cute! It feels like a shame to eat it!","sides":{}},{"idx":13,"id":"S14","text":"Hmph, you're being mean to me again! Fine, I don't care anymore!","sides":{}},{"idx":14,"id":"S15","text":"Right, right! I've been thinking exactly the same thing the whole time!","sides":{}},{"idx":15,"id":"S16","text":"Good morning! Let's play together today too, okay? It's a promise!","sides":{}},{"idx":16,"id":"S17","text":"Hehehe, it's a little secret, okay? You can't tell anyone, alright?","sides":{}},{"idx":17,"id":"S18","text":"I'll never give up, no matter what! I'm gonna show you what I can really do!","sides":{}},{"idx":18,"id":"S19","text":"It's, it's not like I did it for you or anything! Don't get the wrong idea!","sides":{}},{"idx":19,"id":"S20","text":"You still know nothing of the true nature of this world.","sides":{}},{"idx":20,"id":"S21","text":"Alright everyone, are you ready? We're going in at full power!","sides":{}},{"idx":21,"id":"S22","text":"It's okay, I'm right here beside you. There's nothing to worry about.","sides":{}},{"idx":22,"id":"S23","text":"I had lunch with my friend at a new café yesterday.","sides":{}},{"idx":23,"id":"S24","text":"This weekend my whole family is planning to go to the park nearby.","sides":{}},{"idx":24,"id":"S25","text":"You can easily look up the recipe for this dish online.","sides":{}},{"idx":25,"id":"S26","text":"I heard the new building by the station is opening for business next month.","sides":{}},{"idx":26,"id":"S27","text":"I check the news every morning while drinking my coffee.","sides":{}},{"idx":27,"id":"S28","text":"If you transfer trains at the next station, you'll get there a bit faster.","sides":{}},{"idx":28,"id":"S29","text":"I prefer autumn over summer because it's just easier to get through the day.","sides":{}},{"idx":29,"id":"S30","text":"Lately I haven't been able to find time to read, and it's been bothering me.","sides":{}},{"idx":30,"id":"S31","text":"Yes! Let's all go to the festival together this time, okay?","sides":{}},{"idx":31,"id":"S32","text":"No way?! I can't believe something like this is actually happening!","sides":{}},{"idx":32,"id":"S33","text":"It's okay, take your time. Just go at your own pace, alright?","sides":{}},{"idx":33,"id":"S34","text":"When I just stare out the window for a while, my mind starts to settle down.","sides":{}},{"idx":34,"id":"S35","text":"I hope I'm really ready for tomorrow's presentation, I'm getting a little nervous.","sides":{}},{"idx":35,"id":"S36","text":"Thank you for always looking out for me, it really means so much to me.","sides":{}},{"idx":36,"id":"S37","text":"Eeek! Look look, this plushie is sooo fluffy! I just want to squeeze it!","sides":{}},{"idx":37,"id":"S38","text":"Sorry sorry, I'm a bit busy right now, but I promise I'll listen properly later!","sides":{}},{"idx":38,"id":"S39","text":"Hmph, it's not like I want it or anything. You can have it, really.","sides":{}},{"idx":39,"id":"S40","text":"I can see how hard you're trying. Please don't push yourself too much, okay?","sides":{}},{"idx":40,"id":"S41","text":"Today's meeting ended a little earlier than scheduled, which was a real help.","sides":{}},{"idx":41,"id":"S42","text":"It's been getting chilly in the mornings and evenings lately, autumn is here.","sides":{}},{"idx":42,"id":"S43","text":"Their friends were waiting there, but they're not sure exactly where to meet.","sides":{}},{"idx":43,"id":"S44","text":"The application's interface design genuinely has a sleek, sophisticated aesthetic.","sides":{}},{"idx":44,"id":"S45","text":"Could you reschedule the online meeting to accommodate our updated deadline?","sides":{}},{"idx":45,"id":"S46","text":"Regarding next fiscal year's budget allocation, we must deliberate carefully with the relevant departments.","sides":{}},{"idx":46,"id":"S47","text":"Our appointment is scheduled for April fifteenth, twenty twenty-six, at three twenty-five P.M.","sides":{}},{"idx":47,"id":"S48","text":"When I visited the town where I grew up after such a long time, I found that the park where I used to play with my friends was still standing there unchanged, and somehow my heart just felt completely full.","sides":{}},{"idx":48,"id":"S49","text":"Cherry blossoms only bloom for such a brief moment each year, and that's exactly why we end up feeling like we have to cherish and savor every single second of that short window of time.","sides":{}},{"idx":49,"id":"S50","text":"You know that movie I watched yesterday? At first I really thought it was going to be pretty average, but then in the second half the plot suddenly got incredibly interesting, and by the end I was completely moved to tears.","sides":{}}]}]}